      ],
      "image": "assets/images/246556/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place potatoes, chicken, chourico, beer, carrots, onion, parsley, sofrito, cooking wine, sazon seasoning, garlic, salt, and black pepper in a large Dutch oven; mix well to combine. Cover with aluminum foil.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/3VttvvFTtTio8fCJroDwuqgm01o=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/246556-chicken-sofrito-VAT-step-02-2de4b95b0b734c4abc3e7daa009ab98a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/246556/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until an instant-read thermometer inserted into the chicken reads at least 165 degrees F (74 degrees C) and vegetables are tender, about 2 1/2 hours.",
